      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I think this may already work.  I just tried exporting a bag and importing it, and it worked.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It would be great to have some additional testing to verify that it works, and maybe some discussion of whether there are additional requirements (such as verifying the manifest-SHA1.txt checksums instead of using the (presumably identical) checksums from the exported binary descriptions.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
