     "body": "<p>I think this may already work.  I just tried exporting a bag and importing it, and it worked.</p>\n\n<p>It would be great to have some additional testing to verify that it works, and maybe some discussion of whether there are additional requirements (such as verifying the manifest-SHA1.txt checksums instead of using the (presumably identical) checksums from the exported binary descriptions.</p>",
     "created": "12/Dec/16 4:27 PM",
