      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I get this error when importing:</p>\n\n<p>ERROR 12:01:02.300 (ImportExportDriver) Error performing import/export: Error while importing membership resource /Users/awead/Projects/Fedora/fcrepo-import-export/hydra-export/data/rest/dev/3t/94/5q/76/3t945q76s.ttl (400): javax.jcr.PathNotFoundException: No node exists at path '/dev/3t/94/5q/76/3t945q76s/files/74e5b503-0729-49d4-845a-7b5179ec37f6' in workspace \"default</p>\n\n<p>I did this using the hydra dataset: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-sample-dataset/blob/master/additional_datasets/hydra/hydra-dataset.tar.gz\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-sample-dataset/blob/master/additional_datasets/hydra/hydra-dataset.tar.gz</a></p>\n\n<p>to replicate, untar the file and run:<br/>\njava -jar target/fcrepo-import-export-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -m export -d hydra-export -g default -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8986/rest/dev\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8986/rest/dev</a><br/>\njava -jar target/fcrepo-import-export-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -m import -d hydra-export -g default -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8986/rest/dev\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8986/rest/dev</a></p>",
     "created": "13/Dec/16 1:05 PM",
